WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:03.291
- [Narrator:] Buried on the depth chart and left for dead.

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:05.166
- This blue jean baby is fixin' to scrap.

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:09.833
- According to my calculations, it's
time to kick some ass.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:15.666
- [Narrator:} They were never the first choice,
but they are the last hope.

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:18.291
- We're losing starters
at an unprecedented rate.

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:23.708
- I will struggle at first but then ultimately avenge you!

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.791
- I call it ‘Operation Playoff Berth.'

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:29.583
The mission: manage the game and minimize turnovers. 

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:31.541
- [murmurs:] Ridiculous/Impossible!

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:32.583
- IT CAN BE DONE!

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:36.166
- [Narrator:] Now these hired guns are back-up and running.

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:37.541
- It's a suicide mission.

00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:39.166
But there's one thing I've learned:

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.666
It's better to die
a starter than live as a backup.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:45.333
- What you got, kid?

00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:49.833
- Time to let this cat outta the bag.

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.291
- Yeah,

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:54.166
I'm thinkin' I'm Flacc.

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:01.958
- No, no, no.

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:02.833
You can't make me.

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:04.166
- Come on, Zach. We gotta git-

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:05.083
- I SAID NO.

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:08.416
- I got a guy who can take care of a thing...

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:16.791
- [Narrator:] THIS DECEMBER...THE B-TEAM IS THE A-TEAM.

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.083
- Oh, yeah. We're gonna eat that W.

00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.416
We’re gonna sting like a butterfly, and pop like a weasel.

00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:21.041
We’re gonna go-

00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.166
- Hold on to your britches.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.666
We got to make one more stop.

00:01:24.666 --> 00:01:25.708
- So, will you join?

00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:27.166
- F--k you guys. No.

00:01:27.166 --> 00:01:28.916
I'm a leading MVP candidate!

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:31.291
- [Narrator:] The B-Team.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.291
and sometimes the C-Team.

00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:35.250
- Oh, sorry Dobbs. You're out.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.625
- It's impossible.

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:42.250
I can't get you to the playoffs.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:46.000
- Playoffs?! Huh. I just need you to get us to .500.

00:01:46.458 --> 00:01:48.208
- Ooh, that's tough too.

00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:49.583
- DAMN IT, IT'S MY WHOLE THING.

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:50.958
MIKE TOMLIN GETS A WINNING RECORD.

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.500
SO JUST WIN TWO GAMES.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.208
- TWO?!

